{
  "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>롯데월드타워 — 설계 과정 인터랙티브 (개념 재구성)</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#0b1524;--panel:#122238;--panel2:#0d1a2e;--line:#2a4368;--txt:#e9f2fc;--mut:#9db4cc;--cy:#7fd1ff;--am:#ffc857;--ok:#8ef0c0}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml{scroll-behavior:smooth}\nbody{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(1100px 520px at 72% -8%,#173255 0%,var(--bg) 60%);color:var(--txt);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Noto Sans KR\",sans-serif;line-height:1.55}\nheader{padding:22px 18px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(10,20,36,.6)}\nh1{margin:.1em 0;font-size:clamp(1.35rem,3.2vw,2rem);letter-spacing:.02em}\n.sub{margin:.3em 0;color:var(--mut);font-size:.95rem}\n.badge{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;padding:3px 10px;border:1px solid var(--am);border-radius:999px;color:var(--am);font:600 .8rem/1.4 ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em}\n.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 14px 40px}\n.tabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:16px 0}\n.tab,.dbtn,.sbtn,.btn,.chip{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);color:var(--txt);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 15px;font-size:.92rem}\n.tab:hover,.dbtn:hover,.sbtn:hover,.btn:hover,.chip:hover{border-color:var(--cy)}\n.tab[aria-selected=\"true\"],.dbtn.on,.sbtn.on{background:var(--cy);color:#05263d;border-color:var(--cy);font-weight:700}\nbutton:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--am);outline-offset:2px}\n.panel{margin-top:6px}\n.card{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--mut)}\n.legend i{display:inline-block;width:22px;height:0;border-top:3px solid var(--cy);vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px}\n.legend i.e{border-top:3px dashed var(--am)}\n.dbar,.stagebar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:10px 0}\n.fig{margin:0}\n.fig svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background-color:#0c1b30;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(127,209,255,.05) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(127,209,255,.05) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:26px 26px}\nfigcaption{color:var(--mut);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:8px}\nfigcaption b{color:var(--txt)}\nsvg .lbl{fill:var(--txt);font:13px/1.3 system-ui,sans-serif}\nsvg .sml{fill:var(--mut);font:11px/1.3 system-ui,sans-serif}\nsvg .out{fill:none;stroke:var(--cy);stroke-width:2}\nsvg .fillc{fill:rgba(127,209,255,.12);stroke:var(--cy);stroke-width:1.6}\nsvg .est{fill:none;stroke:var(--am);stroke-width:1.6;stroke-dasharray:6 4}\nsvg .filld{fill:#173a5e;stroke:var(--cy);stroke-width:1.2}\nsvg .dim{stroke:var(--cy);stroke-width:1.3;marker-start:url(#mA);marker-end:url(#mA)}\nsvg .dime{stroke:var(--am);stroke-width:1.3;stroke-dasharray:5 4;marker-start:url(#mE);marker-end:url(#mE)}\nsvg .fl{stroke:#4c7ba8;stroke-width:1}\nsvg .core{fill:rgba(255,200,87,.14);stroke:var(--am);stroke-width:1.6}\n.chip{border-color:var(--am);color:var(--am);font-size:.82rem;padding:5px 11px}\n.view{position:relative;height:min(60vh,560px);min-height:340px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0a1322;touch-action:none}\n.view canvas{display:block}\n.view .hint{position:absolute;left:10px;bottom:8px;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--mut);background:rgba(9,18,32,.72);padding:3px 9px;border-radius:8px;pointer-events:none}\n.toolbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:10px 0}\n.btn.on{background:var(--am);color:#3a2a00;border-color:var(--am);font-weight:700}\n.facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:12px 0}\n.fact{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px}\n.fact b{display:block;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--cy)}\n.fact span{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--mut)}\n.fallback{padding:26px;border:1px dashed var(--am);border-radius:12px;color:var(--am)}\nfooter{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:26px;padding:16px 4px;color:var(--mut);font-size:.82rem}\n.src{font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;color:var(--cy)}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}\n@media (max-width:640px){.view{height:54vh;min-height:300px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n<h1>롯데월드타워 — 설계 과정 인터랙티브</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">높이 555m · 지상 123층 · 디자인 KPF · 구조 LERA — 공개 자료를 바탕으로 한 <b>설명용 개념 재구성</b>입니다. 공식 시공 도면·검증된 구조 설계가 아니며, 공개 자료에 없는 치수·단면·부재는 <span style=\"color:var(--am)\">점선(개념 추정)</span>으로 표시합니다.</p>\n<span class=\"badge\">model: kimi-k3</span>\n</header>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<nav class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"섹션 선택\">\n<button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"draw\" aria-selected=\"true\">① 도면</button>\n<button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"stage\" aria-selected=\"false\">② 설계 단계 3D</button>\n<button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"final\" aria-selected=\"false\">③ 완성 모델 3D</button>\n</nav>\n\n<div class=\"facts\" aria-label=\"핵심 사실\">\n<div class=\"fact\"><b>555 m</b><span>정상 높이 (공개 수치)</span></div>\n<div class=\"fact\"><b>지상 123층</b><span>층수 (공개 수치)</span></div>\n<div class=\"fact\"><b>KPF</b><span>원 설계 — 한국 도자기의 선 참고</span></div>\n<div class=\"fact\"><b>LERA</b><span>구조 설계 참여</span></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"legend\" aria-label=\"범례\"><span><i></i>실선: 공개 수치·사실 기반</span><span><i class=\"e\"></i>점선: 개념 추정(추정 치수·부재)</span></p>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ================= DRAWINGS ================= -->\n<section class=\"panel\" id=\"p-draw\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-label=\"도면\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n<div class=\"dbar\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"도면 종류\">\n<button class=\"dbtn on\" data-fig=\"site\" aria-pressed=\"true\">배치도</button>\n<button class=\"dbtn\" data-fig=\"plan\" aria-pressed=\"false\">기준층 평면도</button>\n<button class=\"dbtn\" data-fig=\"elev\" aria-pressed=\"false\">입면도</button>\n<button class=\"dbtn\" data-fig=\"sec\" aria-pressed=\"false\">단면도</button>\n</div>\n\n<svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\" style=\"position:absolute\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs>\n<marker id=\"mA\" viewBox=\"0 0 8 8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0 8 4 0 8z\" fill=\"#7fd1ff\"/></marker>\n<marker id=\"mE\" viewBox=\"0 0 8 8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0 8 4 0 8z\" fill=\"#ffc857\"/></marker>\n</defs></svg>\n\n<figure class=\"fig\" data-fig=\"site\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"배치도: 대지 안 탑 위치와 주변 맥락\"><title>배치도 (개념)</title>\n<rect x=\"18\" y=\"26\" width=\"300\" height=\"368\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3a5c86\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n<rect x=\"404\" y=\"26\" width=\"220\" height=\"368\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3a5c86\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n<rect x=\"318\" y=\"26\" width=\"86\" height=\"368\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3a5c86\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 5\"/>\n<text class=\"sml\" x=\"352\" y=\"215\" transform=\"rotate(90 352 215)\">올림픽로 (개념)</text>\n<path class=\"filld\" d=\"M430 70 Q520 40 590 90 Q630 130 600 210 Q560 300 480 300 Q420 290 428 200 Q432 120 430 70 Z\"/>\n<text class=\"lbl\" x=\"470\" y=\"190\">석촌호수</text>\n<rect class=\"est\" x=\"70\" y=\"90\" width=\"180\" height=\"250\"/>\n<text class=\"sml\" x=\"78\" y=\"84\">대지 경계 약 115m×160m (개념 추정)</text>\n<rect x=\"95\" y=\"120\" width=\"130\" height=\"180\" fill=\"rgba(127,209,255,.08)\" stroke=\"#7fd1ff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" rx=\"14\"/>\n<text class=\"sml\" x=\"105\" y=\"136\">팟디움 (개념)</text>\n<rect class=\"fillc\" x=\"125\" y=\"168\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" rx=\"16\"/>\n<text class=\"lbl\" x=\"131\" y=\"206\">타워</text>\n<circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7fd1ff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n<path d=\"M58 70 L58 48 M51 62 L58 47 L65 62\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7fd1ff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<text class=\"lbl\" x=\"53\" y=\"44\">N</text>\n<path d=\"M80 372 h160 M80 366 v12 M160 366 v12 M240 366 v12\" stroke=\"#7fd1ff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"/>\n<text class=\"sml\" x=\"76\" y=\"364\">0</text><text class=\"sml\" x=\"152\" y=\"364\">50m</text><text class=\"sml\" x=\"228\" y=\"364\">100m</text>\n<text class=\"sml\" x=\"80\" y=\"398\">스케일 바 (화면 표시용 개념 축척)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>배치도 — 보여주는 것:</b> 대지 안에서 타워·팟디움의 위치와 호수·도로 등 주변 맥락. <b>단위 m.</b> 탑이 지상 123층·555m라는 사실 외 대지 치수·도로 위치는 공개 자료에 없으므로 개념 추정(점선)입니다. <button class=\"chip\" data-goto=\"stage:1\">연결: 1단계 매스</button> <button class=\"chip\" data-goto=\"stage:5\">연결: 5단계 완성</button></figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<figure class=\"fig\" data-fig=\"plan\" hidden>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 520\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"기준층 평면도: 층별로 줄어드는 윤곽, 코어, 메가기둥\"><title>기준층 평면도 (개념)</title>\n<rect class=\"fillc\" x=\"215\" y=\"145\" width=\"210\" height=\"210\" rx=\"26\"/>\n<rect class=\"est\" x=\"236\" y=\"166\" width=\"168\" height=\"168\" rx=\"20\"/>\n<rect class=\"est\" x=\"257\" y=\"187\" width=\"126\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\"/>\n<rect class=\"core\" x=\"266\" y=\"196\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\" rx=\"8\"/>\n<path d=\"M278 208 h84 M278 232 h84 M278 256 h84 M278 280 h84\" stroke=\"#ffc857\" stroke-width=\".8\" opacity=\".5\"/>\n<g fill=\"#ffc857\"><rect x=\"228\" y=\"158\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"313\" y=\"150\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"403\" y=\"158\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"228\" y=\"341\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"313\" y=\"349\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"403\" y=\"341\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"215\" y=\"247\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"416\" y=\"247\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/></g>\n<line class=\"dime\" x1=\"215\" y1=\"400\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"400\"/>\n<text class=\"lbl\" x=\"288\" y=\"420\" fill=\"#ffc857\">저층부 폭 약 70m (개념)</text>\n<line class=\"dime\" x1=\"266\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"330\"/>\n<text class=\"sml\" x=\"270\" y=\"346\">코어 약 36m×36m (개념)</text>\n<text class=\"sml\" x=\"216\" y=\"140\">실선: 저층부 기준층 윤곽(기준)</text>\n<text class=\"sml\" x=\"237\" y=\"163\">점선: 중층부(약 56m)·고층부(약 42m) 윤곽 — 상승할수록 축소</text>\n<text class=\"lbl\" x=\"272\" y=\"255\">코어</text>\n<text class=\"sml\" x=\"440\" y=\"250\">■ 메가기둥 8본 (개념)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>기준층 평면도 — 보여주는 것:</b> 위로 갈수록 좁아지는 층 윤곽(저·중·고층 중첩), 중앙 코어, 모서리·변 중앙의 메가기둥 8본. <b>단위 m.</b> 층수 123은 공개 수치, 폭 70/56/42m·코어 36m·기둥 위치는 개념 추정입니다. <button class=\"chip\" data-goto=\"stage:3\">연결: 3단계 구조</button> <button class=\"chip\" data-goto=\"stage:4\">연결: 4단계 층·외피</button></figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<figure class=\"fig\" data-fig=\"elev\" hidden>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 620\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"입면도: 도자기 곡선의 테이퍼 실루엣과 높이 555m\"><title>입면도 (개념)</title>\n<line x1=\"40\" y1=\"560\" x2=\"",
